From 0f95eec88d67a7e3c46564c9f4b3f45457d19dbd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
Date: Wed, 10 Jan 2024 17:44:32 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 0472/1695] plat-stm32mp*: conf: sync with SCP-firmware v2.13
 dev branch

Synchronize stm32mp1 and stm32mp2 with SCP-firmware development
branch v2.13-stm32mp-dev. SCP-firmware includes a module to bind SCMI
voltage domains to optee regulator instances, hence the API has changed.

Stm32mp2 requires SCP-firmware as SCMI service implementation.
Stm32mp13 default use OP-TEE native SCMI server implementation, based
on scmi-msg drivers.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [ST downstream https://github.com/STMicroelectronics/optee_os.git cc3423e1904daf15c7a1273d8da68497e0f61734 plat-stm32mp*: conf: sync with SCP-firmware v2.13 dev branch]
Change-Id: I34b0cef28e8262da9386014546957678d0a355a4
Signed-off-by: Etienne Carriere <etienne.carriere@foss.st.com>
